"<p>To reset the password, please click the button below. If you did not "
"make this request, you can ignore this email but you should change your "
"password.</p>\n"
"<a href='{{{forgotPasswordUrl}}}' class=\"btn-primary\">Magical Password "
"Reset Button</a>"
msgstr ""

